{"slug":"uchi-tama-uchi-no-tama-shirimasen-ka","ad":"Uchi Tama?! Uchi no Tama Shirimasen ka?","adEn":"Uchitama?! Have you seen my Tama?","yil":2020,"puan":66,"format":"TV","durum":"FINISHED","sezon":"WINTER","sure":23,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1624/103162.jpg","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/109964-uZrVTV4PK2ml.jpg","ozet":"Spin-off of \"Tama and Friends\" that reimagines the cast of the franchise as humans.\n\n“Tama & Friends: Have you seen my Tama?” debuted in 1983 as a popular character on stationery and accessories. Tama, the beloved neighborhood cat who is known for the patch on his forehead and yellow ears, has now taken on a human form! Featuring Tama and his quirky friends, Uchitama is a brand-new type of heartwarming anime that might even be the new definition of kawaii!?\n\nIn a city somewhere in Japan, there's a flyer often seen on Third Street with a picture of a cat with a kinked tail, bearing the words: “Have you seen Tama?” A young boy gazes at the flyer, but he has fluffy ears on his head…!? Watch the dogs and cats from Third Street take on a human form and get up to some mischief.\n\nTake a peek into the wonderful lives of Tama and his friends.\n\n(Source: Aniplex of America)","turler":["Komedi","Günlük Yaşam","Antropomorfizm"],"iliski":[{"t":"ALTERNATIVE","s":null,"ad":"Tama & Friends: Uchi no Tama Shirimasen ka?","p":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx87478-drsuBrGB8Zhi.jpg","f":"TV_SHORT"},{"t":"ALTERNATIVE","s":null,"ad":"3 Choume no Tama: Uchi no Tama Shirimasen ka?","p":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b151765-fsNKr9X1gZMk.png","f":"TV"}],"seri":null,"fragman":{"site":"youtube","id":"m_NohQsb3Gs"},"yasal":[{"a":"Crunchyroll","u":"https://www.crunchyroll.com/uchitama-have-you-seen-my-tama"}],"kaynakSayisi":41,"bolumSayisi":11,"bolumler":[{"n":1,"no":"1","ad":"1. Bölüm","slug":"uchi-tama-uchi-no-tama-shirimasen-ka-1-bolum","k